<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equated to FOB Omaha Basis as of 3:00 PM and compared to Thursday's 3:00 PM close, fresh loins were generally steady; butts steady to 2.00 lower; skinned hams steady; sdls. bellies steady to 2.00 lower; lean trimmings steady to 1.00 lower. Trading was slow with light to moderate demand and offerings, USDA Market News said.</p>
